SY_TALK("PPrrWWJgR_Q",[[202,["First, I‘ll speak in Hindi language"]],[208,["and then in English language."]],[218,["Today we have assembled here to worship Shri Maha Deva,"]],[224,["Shri Shiva Shankar."]],[232,["In the name of Shankarji,"]],[235,["many organizations have come up in this world."]],[239,["Because of Adi Shankaracharya’s emphasis,"]],[245,["worshipping ShivJi became very popular among people."]],[250,["And in South India, two types of sects came up:"]],[256,["one which were called Shaivites,"]],[259,["and the others were called Vaishnavites."]],[264,["Now Shaivites are the worshippers of Lord Shiva,"]],[268,["and the Vaishnavites worship Lord Vishnu."]],[273,["In our country we are experts in creating divisions."]],[279,["We divide the Deities as well;"]],[283,["and when we try to integrate them,"]],[286,["then things become even worse."]],[289,["For example, a new thing has come up, called Ayyappa."]],[293,["It is a very wrong thing."]],[296,["And in that it is shown,"]],[301,["that when Lord Vishnu assumed the form of \"Mohini\","]],[305,["then she got a child from Lord Shiva."]],[309,["How is it even possible?"]],[311,["Such wrong ideas are created and widespread in our country,"]],[316,["and then different beliefs groups are formed based on these ideas."]],[319,["When Indians find some or other reason to fight,"]],[322,["they become very happy."]],[325,["If they have nothing to fight over,"]],[329,["then, they create something from their own imaginations."]],[336,["Actually these two aspects are connected with each other"]],[342,["as sun is with sun light,"]],[346,["word with its meaning, moon with the moonlight."]],[350,["Meaning that the \"Sopan Marga\" which is there,"]],[357,["which we call as Sushumna nadi, which is the central path,"]],[365,["it is the path of Lord Vishnu."]],[367,["And through this path we attain the Shiva tattwa."]],[372,["So the destination is Shiva tattwa, Shri Shiva,"]],[377,["and the path is made by Lord Vishnu."]],[382,["To create this path Shri Vishnu and Shri Adishakti"]],[386,["have done a lot of hardwork."]],[388,["Lord Shiva had no role in it."]],[390,["He sits comfortably in his seat,"]],[392,["not bothering about who is coming or who is not coming."]],[396,["So, to attain this Shiva tattwa,"]],[399,["we should go through this Vishnu path (Sushumna nadi)"]],[402,["and for that, we have to first correct the chakras within us."]],[407,["When the centers are corrected,"]],[410,["our Vishnu path opens up."]],[413,["And along with that, we gradually start ascending."]],[419,["I have told you about all these centers, many a times."]],[422,["But there is a chakra in the heart also, which we call `Left Heart’."]],[427,["This is not a heart chakra in essence,"]],[429,["in a way, heart is the reflection,"]],[436,["the reflection of Shri Mahadeva."]],[440,["The abode of Shiva is above everything,"]],[445,["beyond the mind, beyond the thoughts."]],[449,["To attain this kind of tattwa,"]],[452,["first and foremost we should pay attention"]],[456,["and see how pure our heart is."]],[462,["Inside our heart, we nurture a lot of dirt."]],[468,["For example, we feel jealous of someone."]],[474,["feeling jealous like somebody has been evil to you."]],[480,["Even if they might have harmed you also, troubled you"]],[484,["there is no use becoming jeolous of them."]],[488,["If your heart is clean"]],[490,["then the mirror within you,"]],[493,["in which the God Almighty's reflection is going to fall,"]],[496,["will remain clear."]],[498,["But if you have jealousy within,"]],[503,["then the mirror will not remain clean"]],[505,["and the reflection of God will also not be perfect."]],[508,["To have enmity towards anyone"]],[511,["and to have anger or ill feelings in the heart towards anyone,"]],[519,["is very wrong."]],[521,["That is why Christ said that: \"Forgive everyone\"."]],[526,["To forgive is extremely important."]],[529,["And before and after Christ many saints have said the same thing,"]],[535,["that forgive everybody."]],[537,["The moment you forgive, immediately Lord Shiva,"]],[543,["takes the situation in His hands."]],[546,["The subtlest power of all is that of Shri Mahadev."]],[551,["And He, then completely punishes that person,"]],[558,["totally punishes him."]],[561,["This is the responsibility of Lord Mahadev, not yours."]],[565,["Therefore to be jealous of anyone is very bad."]],[570,["But I find that there is lot of jealousy even in Sahaja Yoga."]],[574,["Sahaja Yogis are jealous of one another."]],[577,["If one person is made trustee, the other one is not,"]],[580,["then he becomes jealous."]],[582,["This trusteeship and all has no meaning,"]],[585,["you all know it is a myth."]],[587,["Your Mother has created all this drama"]],[589,["and has spread a web of maya."]],[592,["Even then the mind of the people gets disturbed;"]],[595,["One person's mind gets disturbed"]],[598,["and for the other the heart gets disturbed!"]],[600,["I do not understand what should I do!"]],[603,["Such a big work is happening in so many countries,"]],[606,["so I can communicate with any one person only, right?"]],[610,["However, things are getting sorted out slowly,"]],[613,["but still you will be surprised"]],[617,["that even now there is lot of discussion"]],[620,["about who is the leader and who is what?"]],[624,["Second thing, there is a so-called \"blessing\" for us, Indians,"]],[633,["that jealousy arises in money matters."]],[638,["Even in Sahaja Yoga there is jealousy on money matters."]],[642,["Someone has got more money and some less."]],[646,["Even while doing Sahaja Yoga work"]],[648,["people see how much money one gets,"]],[652,["and who gives how much money?"]],[654,["If a person's heart gets involved with money"]],[657,["he becomes useless for Sahaja Yoga."]],[660,["Because his heart gets covered with materialism."]],[667,["If any kind of materialism has affected you,"]],[672,["then it is very difficult for you to ascend."]],[676,["This is the speciality of our country."]],[678,["I have not seen it so much in foreign countries."]],[680,["But here it is prominent."]],[682,["I think, in Russia and Eastern Block countries"]],[686,["there is very little of wealth,"]],[688,["but they are not bothered at all."]],[690,["They don't think about money at all."]],[692,["But their heart is so pure, so very pure."]],[696,["And only with the pure heart, devotion (bhakti) is possible."]],[700,["We all, before doing prayers, wash our feet and take bath."]],[704,["But if we bathe our heart"]],[708,["and ask God that whatever negativities are there within us,"]],[713,["to please remove them and purify us,"]],[716,["then it will be much better."]],[719,["Third thing, that is within us,"]],[722,["are the six enemies (shadripu)."]],[725,["Shri Krishna has emphasised that krodha (anger) is the worst thing."]],[730,["Everything emanates from anger."]],[732,["A person shows anger initially,"]],[734,["then he gets into delusion."]],[737,["Then he thinks: \"Why did I say all that, I should not have said it\","]],[740,["and so on."]],[741,["But he goes out of self-control, when he gets angry."]],[744,["In the fit of anger he loses control over himself."]],[748,["He goes out of self-control"]],[750,["and he spits out words, which are meaningless."]],[753,["The dirt he has been accumulating since long in his heart,"]],[758,["comes out of his mouth."]],[762,["We have to beware of this krodha."]],[764,["\"Why does this anger come?\" - we should pay attention to this,"]],[767,["that why do we get angry."]],[770,["There are some who are angry with a particular person,"]],[773,["there are some who are angry with the society."]],[776,["Like this, people get angry in different ways."]],[779,["Why does this anger come to us?"]],[782,["\"Why do we get angry?\" - we should think that."]],[786,["Many people have told Me that,"]],[788,["\"Mother, if someone speaks against You, we get very angry\"."]],[793,["I feel like laughing at this."]],[795,["If anybody talks against Me, then I really feel like laughing."]],[799,["Because it doesn't make any sense. What is there to talk against Me?"]],[803,["I am just sharing my love, even then if they speak against Me,"]],[807,["then what can be done?"]],[808,["But some people have a crooked mind,"]],[810,["so we should only pity them."]],[813,["One should think that such people are big fools."]],[817,["When a person is full of anger, then our attitude towards him,"]],[821,["should be very polite."]],[826,["This attitude may also cool down his anger."]],[829,["In our country there are different kinds of angry people."]],[833,["There are institutions for that"]],[835,["who spread with their anger: \"Hit this person, hit that person\","]],[838,["\"Beat up this person, beat up that person\"."]],[841,["And this is also becoming an issue at the social level."]],[844,["This is a very terrifying situation."]],[848,["To beat and thrash people,"]],[850,["and for that purpose to form an army"]],[855,["or prepare some weapons to beat and hurt people"]],[858,["is very terrifying."]],[860,["However, for protection, a person is equipped with these weapons,"]],[867,["it is not a big deal."]],[869,["However, if he is a devotee of the God Almighty,"]],[872,["he doesn’t require these weapons."]],[874,["This kind of a person is always protected."]],[877,["If Shri Mahadev resides within a person,"]],[883,["who can dare to touch such a person,"]],[886,["who can destroy him?"]],[888,["Whatever you do, however you trouble him,"]],[891,["still that person cannot be destroyed."]],[894,["But those who trouble them, will get destroyed themselves."]],[898,["When you will trust this completely,"]],[901,["that whoever is troubling you, will get destroyed,"]],[904,["then your heart will become totally pure and clean."]],[909,["This work can happen only in a pure heart,"]],[912,["because Shri Shiva exists within us, as reflection,"]],[916,["and only the mirror which is clean deserves to have His reflection."]],[921,["Shiva Ji's anger will happen only once,"]],[924,["or rather people say that He gets angry only once."]],[928,["But I have seen him getting angry many a times,"]],[931,["because it is His right."]],[933,["He has a right to be angry."]],[936,["If anyone works against Shri Adi Shakti,"]],[939,["then Shiv Ji has very long hands."]],[942,["Without listening to anyone, He finishes such a person."]],[945,["Because he knows that Shri Adi Shakti will not do anything Herself."]],[949,["She is not going to punish anyone at all,"]],[953,["and She will forgive everyone."]],[955,["So, His hands are so long,"]],[958,["then there is no limit,"]],[960,["and when those hands start lashing, then nobody can stop them."]],[963,["Who dares to say anything to Him?"]],[965,["He has got His own maryadas,"]],[968,["which you can neither change nor go beyond."]],[973,["You should understand that in your individual life,"]],[978,["in Sahaja Yoga, you have to follow Lord Shiva."]],[983,["Because, if you don't follow Him, firstly,"]],[999,["You will get heart problems."]],[1002,["First thing, is that you will get heart disease."]],[1006,["It works out in two ways."]],[1008,["Firstly with excessive anger the heart catches,"]],[1013,["and secondly, after the anger if a person repents,"]],[1017,["then he gets the disease called \"angina\"."]],[1021,["This is how both the things are useless."]],[1024,["But one cannot quit anger, just by saying."]],[1026,["This is something like alcohol."]],[1028,["It becomes a habit to get angry."]],[1030,["He starts relishing it, his face gets puffed up,"]],[1033,["he gets extremly angry and no one can control him."]],[1037,["So, I thought that if you sit before the mirror"]],[1040,["and get angry on yourself,"]],[1043,["rebuke yourself with few angry words"]],[1046,["and by sitting in front of the mirror if you say:"]],[1049,["\"There cannot be a greater fool than me\","]],[1052,["then perhaps you may get rid of your anger."]],[1056,["I am saying: \"It might be possible\","]],[1058,["because at times, these problems are so intricate,"]],[1061,["that it is very difficult to solve them."]],[1065,["Further, it has been observed"]],[1067,["that the more we focus our attention on something"]],[1074,["and the more we react to it..."]],[1081,["Someone says something and we react instantly to it -"]],[1085,["this custom is more in the foreign countries."]],[1088,["For example there is a carpet -"]],[1090,["immediately they will comment, “I don’t like it!\", \"I like it!”."]],[1094,["Who are you to say all this?"]],[1097,["Nowadays it's a fashion to say: \"I like it\", \"I don’t like it\"."]],[1101,["As if every person is a renowned master,"]],[1106,["who goes on saying: `I like it’, `I don’t like it’."]],[1110,["This should not be said."]],[1111,["Saying this is the indication of your Agnya caught up."]],[1115,["What do you think of yourself"]],[1117,["that you are saying: \"I like it, I don't like it\"?"]],[1121,["You do not have a right to like or dislike any of the things."]],[1127,["Supposing, some poor man gives you with affection,"]],[1129,["some very beautiful flowers,"]],[1132,["and you say: \"Sir, I don't like this flowers\","]],[1135,["you are unable to understand the hidden emotions behind this act"]],[1141,["because Shiva tattwa is absent in you."]],[1144,["Even if it is a very small thing,"]],[1146,["which has been given to you by a poor person,"]],[1149,["you don't recognise the feeling attached to the emotion,"]],[1155,["and how lovingly he has brought that for you."]],[1158,["For that in India the example of Sudama has been shown,"]],[1163,["that how he arrived with roasted rice to meet Shri Krishna"]],[1168,["and how Shri Krishna honoured Him."]],[1172,["Anything given with the feeling of love"]],[1175,["is like a piece of glass on which when paras (mercury) is applied"]],[1179,["it becomes a shining mirror."]],[1182,["Similarly, if you have feelings of love for someone,"]],[1186,["a very beautiful and good feeling,"]],[1189,["but you have no money,"]],[1190,["then even if you gift that person a very small thing,"]],[1194,["then that person should think:"]],[1196,["\"Aha! What an excellent thing it is\"."]],[1199,["This feeling of love"]],[1202,["gives a subtle sight to the person,"]],[1205,["which can be called as artistic,"]],[1208,["artistic qualities emanates from it."]],[1210,["When art is visible from it,"]],[1212,["you start thinking how artistic that thing is."]],[1215,["This art is the art of love, is the art of love."]],[1219,["By this art you can clearly see"]],[1222,["how much love is in that person,"]],[1226,["how affectionate he is, how loving he is,"]],[1229,["what a gentleman he is, what a good person he is."]],[1233,["When you start seeing these qualities in others,"]],[1236,["then you will look within yourself,"]],[1238,["and will start thinking: \"How am I?”"]],[1242,["“Do I have that much love?”,"]],[1244,["“Do I have this gentleman's qualities\"?"]],[1246,["\"Do I have all this goodness within me,"]],[1248,["or am I rendering lip service only?"]],[1253,["And thus misleading the people\"."]],[1256,["Actually we are misleading ourselves only."]],[1259,["When we are doing wrong things, living a wrong lifestyle,"]],[1263,["when our lives are completely filled"]],[1265,["with wrong conceptions,"]],[1268,["then we cannot make anyone happy"]],[1270,["and definitely we cannot be happy as well."]],[1273,["So from the point of view of “swartha”,"]],[1275,["\"swartha\" - this word is very beautiful -"]],[1277,["it means \"to know thy Self\" (swa ka arth)."]],[1280,["\"Swa\" means the Spirit - you must know the meaning of it."]],[1283,["To know the meaning of it people worship Shri Shiva."]],[1287,["But I have seen that the worshipers of Shiva are very hot tempered,"]],[1293,["full of anger, very miserly and what not."]],[1298,["No one is as generous as Shri Shiva,"]],[1301,["no one is as loving as Shri Shiva."]],[1304,["He is the source of love;"]],[1306,["the love which is flowing all around is the leela of His Holy feet."]],[1310,["It is due to Him this work is happening,"]],[1313,["that people are fully immersed in the ocean of love in Sahaja Yoga."]],[1318,["After coming to Sahaja Yoga,"]],[1320,["when you attain the state,"]],[1324,["the state which should be called as Jiva Atma,"]],[1327,["then your attention,"]],[1332,["your attention gets engrossed in the Lotus Feet of Shiv Ji."]],[1337,["And as soon as it gets engrossed in Shri Shiva's Lotus Feet,"]],[1341,["what happens within you,"]],[1344,["is that whatever qualities of the five elements are there,"]],[1350,["they also become very subtle."]],[1353,["I have already told you about the four elements,"]],[1356,["but the fifth one, which is called ‘ether’ in English,"]],[1360,["I didn’t tell you about."]],[1362,["Here it is called \"akash\"."]],[1363,["Akash tattwa is that, when a seeker attains the subtle state,"]],[1369,["then he attains the subtlety of the ether element."]],[1373,["That ”akash” which drives the ether,"]],[1376,["that akash which..."]],[1382,["is self-driven."]],[1385,["If a person has any problem or any trouble,"]],[1391,["then through this omnipresent akash tattwa,"]],[1397,["which is everywhere,"]],[1400,["instantly the effect of your attention reaches where it is required."]],[1405,["It is an amazing thing, but it happens and it happened also."]],[1409,["People may call it miracle, but it is not."]],[1413,["In Sahaja Yoga if your Shiva tatwa is awakened,"]],[1418,["then all the subtle,"]],[1421,["the subtlest of the subtle emotions and state"]],[1428,["get awakened within you."]],[1430,["Therefore it is necessary for us to purify our heart first."]],[1435,["Previously I have talked to you about three enemies."]],[1440,["Now, the fourth enemy present within us is \"madha\"."]],[1444,["\"Madha\" means ego."]],[1449,["When this ego affects the women,"]],[1452,["they start walking like men."]],[1455,["Then they cannot walk like women because of the pride -"]],[1458,["\"I am something very special\" kind of feeling."]],[1461,["Supposing a girl either comes from a very rich family,"]],[1468,["or she is very beautiful,"]],[1470,["or very well educated, whatever is the reason,"]],[1473,["if she gets ego by anything,"]],[1476,["then she starts walking like a man."]],[1481,["And when a man is affected by ego,"]],[1485,["he starts walking like a woman."]],[1488,["Meaning such a man makes himself up,"]],[1490,["for hours sits before the mirror, combs his hair, does this, that"]],[1496,["does all kinds of feminine actions."]],[1499,["To dress up is the job of the women."]],[1501,["While walking also he doesn't walk straight,"]],[1503,["he walks in a peculiar style."]],[1505,["From behind, if you see him,"]],[1507,["you will feel as if a lady is walking in a male dress."]],[1512,["So, when a man"]],[1516,["gets intoxicated with this ego (madha),"]],[1521,["then he is completely lost in his own world."]],[1524,["In his ego, he starts swaying like an elephant."]],[1528,["All his actions become different."]],[1531,["Whether they talk or don't talk, the way they sit -"]],[1536,["in every action it is evident"]],[1538,["that they have some kind of ego within them."]],[1541,["It is difficult to understand the cause of their ego,"]],[1545,["what makes them think that they are special."]],[1548,["All these things are petty things."]],[1551,["They have no meaning at all."]],[1553,["In Sahaja Yoga they have no meaning at all."]],[1556,["And so that is why"]],[1559,["to believe in these kind of things,"]],[1561,["that \"we are something special\","]],[1563,["then you just end up to be worse than ordinary."]],[1566,["You do not remain extraordinary, you become worse than ordinary."]],[1569,["It means that it's not wise to have any imagination about yourself,"]],[1574,["that \"I am very rich\" or \"I am something great\"."]],[1577,["Now even the poor people suffer from ego."]],[1580,["Even the dalits have become egoistical, it's beyond understanding."]],[1583,["People talk as if they are something very great."]],[1588,["What are you as an individual?"]],[1590,["A devotee of God Almighty."]],[1594,["You are Sahaja Yogis, who believe in God."]],[1599,["To think about yourself that you are something great,"]],[1603,["is to go away from the state of joy (anand),"]],[1605,["because the power of Shiva gives the state of joy to the seeker."]],[1609,["To get absorbed in the state of joy,"]],[1613,["people worship Lord Shiva."]],[1615,["But I have seen that most of the Shiva bhaktas"]],[1618,["are quite grumpy people -"]],[1619,["no one can talk to them."]],[1621,["What is the use?"]],[1623,["They worship Shri Shiva who is verily Natraj,"]],[1626,["from whom emanate all forms of art,"]],[1629,["who is extremely joyful,"]],[1632,["who is the embodiment of \"anand\"."]],[1634,["In front of Him, how could these people be called His bhaktas?"]],[1638,["They hang such a big linga around their neck,"]],[1641,["which could give them a heart attack."]],[1643,["What is the need for that?"]],[1644,["You can yourself become the \"linga swarupa\"."]],[1647,["Without becoming that,"]],[1649,["they claim: \"We are Shiva bhaktas\","]],[1654,["and start fighting after worshipping Shri Shiva."]],[1656,["And they have different marks."]],[1658,["Shiva bhaktas will put mark across the forehead,"]],[1662,["and Vishnu bhaktas will put the mark along the forehead."]],[1665,["Oh! What does this mean?"]],[1669,["Vertical application means that you are ascending - alright!"]],[1672,["You are ascending"]],[1675,["and once you reach that state you should become peaceful."]],[1678,["The mark should be applied both ways, or not be applied at all."]],[1682,["It should have some meaning,"]],[1684,["that those who are trying to achieve Shri Shiva,"]],[1687,["should go through the central path (\"Sopan marg\")."]],[1689,["While passing through this path,"]],[1691,["you have to leave behind all the negativities."]],[1696,["Before criticizing others, learn to criticize yourself."]],[1701,["Say it to yourself: \"I am like this, I am like that\"."]],[1705,["When you start critisizing yourself,"]],[1707,["then you will see that all the bhoots will run away."]],[1710,["Because we have gathered all these negativities,"]],[1713,["by our continuous thought process, by our Agnya."]],[1717,["By the excessive use of Agnya,"]],[1719,["we start accumulating negative forces,"]],[1721,["everything transforms into a mental projection"]],[1723,["and such a person becomes troublesome and creates misery."]],[1727,["And that misery makes him also miserable."]],[1731,["By giving unhappiness to others, you can never be happy."]],[1734,["It will have its impact on you even if you are a stone."]],[1737,["It will have its impact"]],[1739,["and the impact is such that the person becomes unhappy."]],[1745,["As far as a Mother is concerned,"]],[1748,["She always thinks of your welfare."]],[1751,["She thinks what makes you happy,"]],[1754,["what gives you contentment,"]],[1756,["what gives you peace of mind."]],[1758,["what can give you love"]],[1760,["and what makes you become a saintly person in this world."]],[1764,["This is the method of the Mother,"]],[1766,["but this is not Shri Shiva's method."]],[1768,["He tolerates upto a certain limit and then deals so severely"]],[1772,["that I get terrified that what is going to happen to that person."]],[1776,["Where shall he reach? What is he going to do?"]],[1779,["Shri Shiva doesn't think that."]],[1781,["It is not in His nature to think that:"]],[1785,["\"Even if he is very bad and evil, I will forgive him!\"."]],[1791,["Yes, if the person is worthy of His forgiveness, then He forgives."]],[1795,["And those who meditate upon Him and do lot of penance,"]],[1798,["He blesses them with boons."]],[1800,["But that person who, basically, does not want to correct himself,"]],[1808,["Lord Shiva sets him right."]],[1810,["It is a fact."]],[1811,["That’s why we should be scared of Him as He is called ”Bhayankar” (Terrifying)."]],[1815,["When He gets angry then He does not forgive anyone."]],[1819,["But His worst anger comes during the doomsday,"]],[1824,["what we call: \"the night when the whole creation will be finished\"."]],[1828,["At that time, He will destroy everything with his anger."]],[1832,["That time, as I have told you, is the Last Judgement."]],[1839,["During this time which path you take to, where you go,"]],[1843,["whatever you do,"]],[1845,["all these things are completely stored within you."]],[1851,["Every small detail about you is recorded"]],[1854,["and accordingly you are sent either to Heaven or to Hell."]],[1860,["It is Lord Shiva who sends people to Hell, not Me."]],[1864,["I have nothing to do with the Hell (Naraka)."]],[1866,["But Lord Shiva has."]],[1868,["He will pull you by your legs and throw you in the Hell."]],[1871,["Then you cannot say that \"I am the worshipper of the Mother,"]],[1876,["and I am the follower of Mother, then why is this happening to me?\"."]],[1882,["I am not instrumental in that."]],[1884,["Once someone calls Me Mother, then I can not think ill of him."]],[1889,["But, If I am the maryada for Shri Shiva"]],[1893,["then He is my maryada (limit) too."]],[1895,["But, in this regard since we both are totally opposite in nature,"]],[1900,["you have to be very careful."]],[1904,["And the eleven Rudras present in Christ"]],[1907,["are also the manifestation of Shri Shiva."]],[1908,["The emotions of the Rudras are the form of Lord Shiva,"]],[1912,["that is why, you have to be very careful."]],[1917,["Regarding this I have to warn you,"]],[1921,["because even in Sahaja Yoga some people come to earn money,"]],[1925,["some talk ill of others, some do wrong things,"]],[1928,["some do injustice."]],[1930,["Such persons are sieved out of the stream."]],[1933,["But as soon as they are out, they get into the orbit of Lord Shiva."]],[1937,["Then I get the news that they have gone bankrupt,"]],[1940,["this happened, that happened. I say: \"Now don't tell Me this\"."]],[1944,["They themselves came out of His protection,"]],[1946,["then who could save them?"]],[1949,["So, you should try to seek your protection in Lord Shiva."]],[1955,["Of course, you are protected by Mother,"]],[1957,["but you should seek also Lord Shiva's protection."]],[1960,["For that, I told you about the five elements."]],[1964,["The subtelty of these five elements should be attained by you."]],[1970,["And to achieve that state you should meditate regularly."]],[1977,["Those who meditate, look totally different"]],[1980,["and those who do not meditate also look different in another way,"]],[1984,["no doubt about it."]],[1986,["Now those who meditate but they are not willing to do it,"]],[1989,["whose attention is not there in meditation,"]],[1991,["those who do not have understanding or discretion for meditation,"]],[1995,["and they have a kind of laziness towards it,"]],[1998,["then that meditation is not fruitful,"]],[2002,["one does not get any benefit from it."]],[2005,["Meditation should be such"]],[2007,["that each and every cell of your body gets filled with joy"]],[2013,["and bliss showers over you."]],[2015,["Lord Shiva's first and most important blessing"]],[2023,["is that He gives you joy, He fills your being with happiness."]],[2029,["Even only by chanting His name,"]],[2033,["a person should become joyous."]],[2036,["But instead people always behave in an opposite way."]],[2041,["I feel surprised that nothing is as expected,"]],[2045,["that the people whom we think to be Shiva bhaktas (devotees),"]],[2048,["how could they be such dry personalities?"]],[2053,["Not possible at all."]],[2055,["There is one more reason for it."]],[2058,["Those who are always busy working, too busy,"]],[2063,["they become right sided."]],[2066,["When they become too much right sided,"]],[2068,["they get devoid of Lord Shiva."]],[2071,["They move away from Lord Shiva;"]],[2073,["and then Shri Shiva shows His power."]],[2077,["Now you know that Shri Saraswati is the sister of Lord Shiva."]],[2081,["The worshippers of Shri Saraswati,"]],[2083,["I mean the people who read and write, who gather knowledge,"]],[2088,["and apart from that, who are interested in art,"]],[2095,["who are genuine art lovers,"]],[2097,["this kind of people who worship Shri Saraswati, pay homage to Her,"]],[2102,["they should know first of all that She is Shri Shiva's sister"]],[2106,["and you know that sister's relationship is very powerful."]],[2110,["If you try to deceit His sister,"]],[2115,["adopt any bad qualities or talk ill of Her -"]],[2119,["for example, many people write impure literature or bad books,"]],[2123,["many people have knowledge, but they distort it -"]],[2127,["this kind of people cannot escape the wrath of Shri Shiva."]],[2131,["Because His sister is very important."]],[2135,["And to deceive Her is the greatest sin."]],[2139,["In His view, it is a very big sin."]],[2142,["And regarding Shri Adi Shakti His protocols are equally rigid,"]],[2149,["there is no doubt about that."]],[2151,["Please check this mike. It is falling off."]],[2156,["And now, Sahaja Yogis,"]],[2160,["first of all have to pay attention towards themselves."]],[2164,["I do not mean that they should sit before the mirror for hours."]],[2167,["Not at all."]],[2168,["Sitting before the mirror all the time, is also considered a disease."]],[2172,["I mean to say that you should have attention towards your Self,"]],[2177,["look at yourself and see: \"What are the problems within me\"?"]],[2183,["“What wrong things am I doing?”."]],[2186,["In our Indian culture,"]],[2189,["the straight path, which has been suggested, should be taken."]],[2193,["In this time a new era has come,"]],[2195,["in which people think they can live as they want, but it is not so."]],[2200,["Being in India,"]],[2202,["you have to be in total harmony with the Indian culture."]],[2206,["Your life style should remain connected to lndian culture,"]],[2212,["because in our culture, Shiva tattwa is given great importance."]],[2216,["Most important of all is Shiva tattwa."]],[2219,["And Shiva tattwa only has created our \"maryadas\"."]],[2223,["The moment you cross these maryadas, you are finished."]],[2228,["All these maryadas which are in our culture"]],[2231,["are because of the grace of Lord Shiva."]],[2235,["Whatever has been told to us so far: \"Don't do this, don't do that\","]],[2240,["everything big and small,"]],[2242,["these maryadas (boundaries) have been laid by Lord Shiva."]],[2245,["He is so much concerned about His maryadas"]],[2250,["that the moment you step over these boundaries,"]],[2254,["you get affected."]],[2258,["Now, in the name of Shiva tattwa,"]],[2259,["people have created so many wrong ideas."]],[2263,["Like many people think that taking \"bhaang\" (an intoxicating drink)"]],[2266,["can awaken Shiva tattwa."]],[2269,["Many others who consume liquor think"]],[2272,["that drinking alcohol submerges you in Shiva tattwa!"]],[2275,["Many wrong ideas of this type have been created by people,"]],[2279,["that this kind of acts are all right for Shri Shiva,"]],[2282,["because He has done that."]],[2285,["Shri Shiva drank poison also."]],[2288,["Would you also drink poison?"]],[2291,["He drank poison to make the whole world free from it."]],[2297,["That is why He used to eat \"dhatura\" (jimsonweed),"]],[2301,["because \"dhatura\" contains poison."]],[2304,["Similarly you might have heard"]],[2307,["that Sai Nath used plenty of tobacco."]],[2312,["He used to fill it in a pipe and inhale the smoke."]],[2316,["The reason was that most people in Maharashtra are tobacco addicts."]],[2320,["A minister also will consume tobacco"]],[2322,["and his servant will also consume it."]],[2325,["And the minister will ask a servant: \"Give me tobacco if you have\"."]],[2330,["To this great extent there people are used to tobacco"]],[2335,["although tobacco is not grown here, in Maharashtra."]],[2338,["But somehow they are crazy for tobacco."]],[2341,["To such great extent people consume tobacco in Maharashtra."]],[2344,["To free people of this addiction Sainath thought:"]],[2349,["\"Why don't I consume all the tobacco?\"."]],[2352,["That is why He used to inhale tobacco."]],[2356,["But people started saying: \"Sainath is smoking, so we also can do\"."]],[2359,["Because of these kind of people, He used to consume tobacco"]],[2364,["so that the tobacco addiction of these people will come to an end."]],[2369,["Now, whatever you call it, tobacco is tobacco,"]],[2373,["and there is no connection between Lord Shiva and tobacco"]],[2377,["but definitely He wanted to destroy it from the whole world."]],[2385,["Now supposing we take the example of Goddess"]],[2387,["and the job of the Goddess is to eat all the bhoots,"]],[2392,["so would you also eat bhoots?"]],[2395,["Also the job of the Goddess is"]],[2398,["to absorb whatever diseases you have."]],[2407,["So, would you dare to do that?"]],[2409,["This is not your job."]],[2412,["Similarly, whatever the saints and sages have done,"]],[2416,["you neither have the power to do it right now,"]],[2420,["nor it is your job."]],[2422,["Your job is to cleanse yourself,"]],[2425,["to correct yourself and first attain that state."]],[2430,["Then all the other matters will be alright."]],[2432,["But if you don't reach that state, it is useless."]],[2436,["For you, doing all these rituals is a waste."]],[2439,["There are many things,"]],[2441,["which can be justified wrongly."]],[2448,["But if we have to go in the right direction, walk on the right path,"]],[2453,["then first of all we have to purify our hearts."]],[2457,["All these habits that we are addicted to,"]],[2460,["these habits also altogether"]],[2464,["affect our heart."]],[2467,["So in the olden times, it so happened,"]],[2470,["that all the disciples who came, were made to sleep in jungles."]],[2484,["They used to live in jungles among the snakes, scorpions"]],[2488,["spiders and all other animals,"]],[2493,["so that they do not get addicted to a luxurious life."]],[2498,["At the most they could sleep in huts,"]],[2500,["which were covered with cow dung."]],[2505,["They used to live a very simple life and wear minimal clothes,"]],[2509,["so that children do not become crazy about clothes."]],[2515,["\"We want to wear these cloths, those shoes, we want this food\" -"]],[2520,["Sahaja Yogis should not say all this."]],[2523,["You know that your Mother can live anywhere,"]],[2526,["can sleep anywhere, can eat any food."]],[2528,["So Indians have a craze for taste within -"]],[2532,["all the people here are very fond of eating."]],[2538,["Sahaja Yogis also invite each other for having food together."]],[2544,["Ladies particularly have to say, wherever I go,"]],[2547,["\"Mother, come to our house to have some food\"."]],[2550,["My food habits are very different."]],[2552,["I cannot eat in a hotel, I cannot eat anywhere."]],[2556,["Even in my own house I eat without salt and sugar."]],[2561,["I am not bothered about taste since childhood."]],[2565,["I eat whatever is available."]],[2567,["But Indian tongues are very fond of spicy and tangy tastes."]],[2571,["Whether they are from from U.P., from Punjab or from South,"]],[2578,["in the matter of eating, Indians are great experts."]],[2583,["And women befool the men by serving them good food."]],[2588,["\"My husband is fond of this food, my husband is fond of that food\""]],[2594,["What to do?"]],[2596,["Women will be slaves to their husbands and try to please them."]],[2599,["If they keep talking about food day and night,"]],[2602,["then they are not Sahaja Yogis."]],[2605,["And when I was there in Milan,"]],[2609,["during the program of Guru puja,"]],[2612,["I Myself cooked the food. What to do?"]],[2614,["For four years I Myself cooked there,"]],[2617,["because no one else prepared tasty food."]],[2620,["People would say: \"Mother, it tastes just like plastic\"."]],[2623,["In particular, the Indians."]],[2625,["All the Indians who come there for Puja, have to meet Me,"]],[2629,["as if they have special right over Me."]],[2631,["Also they are very critical about the food,"]],[2633,["that the food served here is not good."]],[2635,["Now one more new thing has begun among Indians,"]],[2639,["that they want attached bathrooms."]],[2643,["Their bathrooms, if you go to their houses and see,"]],[2647,["how their parents lived there..."]],[2649,["Now, they want attached bathroom, that too western style."]],[2653,["I am mentioning this today, because I am tired of it."]],[2657,["In Ganapatipule, I provided western bathrooms separately for them."]],[2663,["At first I provided Indian toilets,"]],[2665,["thinking that Indians will like Indian style."]],[2669,["And I provided foreign people with western style."]],[2671,["But then Indians said: \"We also need western bathrooms\"."]],[2674,["Now what is this?"]],[2676,["I said: \"Now a strike is going to start here\"."]],[2679,["I said: \"Take tumblers and go to jungle, that is what you deserve\"."]],[2684,["For years together they have been going like this,"]],[2687,["but now they have become great sahabs and want attached bathrooms."]],[2692,["Poor western people, poor foreigners who came from abroad said:"]],[2697,["\"Mother, we prefer Indian style, because they are very clean."]],[2702,["So give us Indian bathrooms only\"."]],[2703,["Then I changed the arrangement"]],[2705,["and Indians were very happy that they got attached bathrooms."]],[2710,["You should be ashamed of it."]],[2712,["Sahaja Yogis should be ashamed talking about such things."]],[2716,["Your forefathers used to go to jungle with tumblers"]],[2718,["so why do you have this new craze?"]],[2720,["Do you have some disease or any other problem?"]],[2724,["They put Me in great trouble."]],[2726,["But somehow it struck Me that:"]],[2728,["\"Okay, you take this and you take that\"."]],[2734,["This kind of giving excuses and doing such things,"]],[2737,["is something only Indians do."]],[2739,["You will be surprised, people who come to Cabella,"]],[2743,["all of them stay with one another,"]],[2745,["though they are very rich people, they have cars and everything,"]],[2748,["still they would sleep in the pendal."]],[2750,["But Indians will have a special place for themselves,"]],[2754,["they will stay in hotels and roam around in cars."]],[2757,["They do not have, even to a small extent,"]],[2760,["any kind of sacrificing attitude."]],[2764,["They have not learnt how to sacrifice."]],[2766,["The way we became so modern nowadays, it's beyond My understanding."]],[2772,["Now, there are no servants in foreigners' houses."]],[2775,["So, they have no attached bath,"]],[2777,["they have only one bathroom, because they only have to clean it."]],[2781,["You all have servants, so you can afford even ten bathrooms."]],[2785,["But all these things are taking you away from your own powers."]],[2791,["Your attention is going in useless things."]],[2794,["Frittering away of the attention in absurdities,"]],[2797,["all this will make you a very ordinary human being."]],[2804,["Among women, it is fashion nowadays to go to beauty parlours."]],[2808,["Their face remains the same."]],[2810,["They will spend money there, do this here and do that there."]],[2813,["In Pune, the wife of brahmins"]],[2816,["will wear sleeveless dresses, use goggles"]],[2820,["and roam around in a moped."]],[2823,["I don't understand it."]],[2827,["In Pune, which is punya-pattanam (land of good deeds)."]],[2829,["Is this the way to do good deeds?"]],[2832,["We are adopting to western style in such a way,"]],[2836,["without thinking where is Shiva tattwa in this?"]],[2841,["Look at Shri Shiva,"]],[2844,["He sits comfortably with minimal clothes."]],[2846,["In His marriage procession also He sat upon Nandi and went."]],[2849,["Why Nandi? Because Nandi is His disciple."]],[2853,["Whatever He says, Nandi will nod his head."]],[2856,["He can tell Nandi anything, that's why he is His dearest disciple."]],[2861,["Now, He sat upon Nandi and arrived at His wedding venue."]],[2866,["So, Parvati Ji had no objection,"]],[2869,["but Her brother, Shri Vishnu got a little worried:"]],[2871,["\"Why is the bridegroom coming in this manner?\"."]],[2875,["I do not mean that you become this kind of a groom,"]],[2879,["I don't mean that, but still, to overdo things"]],[2884,["and spending unnecessarily is of no use."]],[2889,["Be sensible."]],[2891,["Wisdom is your ornament."]],[2894,["To accept everything, whatever is there, is alright."]],[2898,["Food - alright."]],[2899,["Now, if they go to someone's house for food,"]],[2902,["they will keep critisizing the host."]],[2905,["May not be in front of them but back home they'll say:"]],[2907,["\"What kind of food was that?\"."]],[2909,["If the host cooked good, then they demand same food in their house."]],[2914,["The whole day attention is on taste of the tongue -"]],[2918,["it is too much in India, beyond the limit."]],[2922,["This kind attention should be reduced."]],[2925,["The foreign yogis eat Indian food. I've never heard any complaint."]],[2930,["Although, you can never eat their western food."]],[2939,["But the way you have coated yourself with these things,"]],[2944,["will not let you get into the deeper joy."]],[2948,["To achieve the joy of Lord Shiva,"]],[2953,["it is said that you have to renounce everything."]],[2957,["First renounce the world,"]],[2959,["go to Himalayas and stand on one leg."]],[2961,["Wear minimal clothes."]],[2964,["Take a dip in the river and then meditate in wet clothes."]],[2969,["They used to torture the body in every possible way."]],[2971,["Even these days gurus beat their disciples."]],[2974,["They trouble them a lot."]],[2976,["They don't give Realisation so easily, no way."]],[2979,["After going through lot of troubles,"]],[2982,["then the disciples get Realization,"]],[2985,["but their Realization establishes in them, strongly."]],[2991,["Instead, you all have got Realization easily"]],[2993,["but your past things are still lingering in your brain."]],[2998,["These problems are still with you."]],[3000,["Now what to do with them?"]],[3002,["They need to be shaken off."]],[3004,["All these things which we have accumulated"]],[3007,["need to be pushed away, totally finished."]],[3009,["And for that there is no need to make a show,"]],[3011,["renounce the world or leave the home and family."]],[3015,["Any kind of \"Dravidi Pranayama\" (breathing technique) is not required."]],[3020,["But one thing is a must,"]],[3025,["your temptation of the taste should be reduced,"]],[3028,["should be reduced gradually."]],[3031,["You should become oblivious of taste."]],[3033,["It is very important."]],[3035,["Oblivion to the taste is a great quality."]],[3038,["People get enraged if they do not get food of their choice."]],[3042,["They throw away their plates, beat their servants and what not?"]],[3048,["If you can conquer your tongue,"]],[3053,["then many sweet shops may close down, in My opinion."]],[3058,["However, I mean to say"]],[3063,["that the body should not be given much importance."]],[3066,["If the body needs comfort,"]],[3068,["like you want to sleep on a bed and can't sleep on the ground,"]],[3071,["then for ten days sleep on the ground."]],[3074,["How can you not sleep like that?"]],[3076,["You should not give up until you have enslaved your body."]],[3079,["Your attention should go away from your comfort."]],[3083,["There are many people who cannot travel by bus,"]],[3087,["because they can only go by car."]],[3091,["Then they ask for a car from here, there,"]],[3093,["sit in this car, sit in that car..."]],[3095,["But none of them will think:"]],[3097,["\"Come, let me travel by bus today and see what happens?\""]],[3101,["And earlier there were no buses also, so people used to walk."]],[3104,["When we were in school, we used to walk five miles daily,"]],[3108,["though we had car and everything."]],[3111,["Such parents we had."]],[3114,["But we ourselves were very fond of walking barefoot,"]],[3117,["without shoes, carrying slippers in our hand."]],[3121,["Because of the vibrations it was good to walk on the earth."]],[3125,["You should also start walking without shoes and slippers sometimes."]],[3130,["It is very important and very beneficial."]],[3133,["Mother Earth will get vibrations and you will also feel nice."]],[3136,["In everything, we have become excessively comfort loving people."]],[3142,["We have become just like the few Nawabs of earlier days."]],[3146,["And what did we get? We can get nothing from that."]],[3149,["We will waste our whole lives by being enslaved to these things."]],[3152,["We have to reduce this slavery,"]],[3154,["and establish within us the essence (tattwa) of Param Shiva."]],[3159,["And for that it is essential that everything else becomes unimportant."]],[3164,["Today wear this, tomorrow wear that,"]],[3167,["and that will match with this dress and so on."]],[3170,["Whatever is available accept it."]],[3172,["Whatever comes your way wear that."]],[3175,["It is not a problem,"]],[3177,["you will not get in any trouble because of that."]],[3180,["On the contrary you will be happy that you are a contented person:"]],[3184,["\"Whatever I got, I accepted with content\"."]],[3188,["Nowadays in our Nagpur,"]],[3190,["I don't know if the situation is same here as well,"]],[3193,["the price of the gas cylinder has gone up by Rs. 16."]],[3197,["Then the photos of protesting women came in the newspaper,"]],[3200,["all well dressed, with heavy make-up."]],[3202,["I said that their powder itself must be worth Rs. 15."]],[3210,["These people think: \"If others are going for strike,"]],[3213,["then we are also joining\"."]],[3215,["What for?"]],[3216,["Because the price increased by Rs. 15."]],[3218,["Can't you see that your salary has also increased?"]],[3223,["Earlier, supposing, we were paying Rs. 20-25  to our servants,"]],[3228,["today we pay Rs. 2500."]],[3230,["He also complains, though he gets clothes and other things also."]],[3234,["Salaries have increased so much, then would the prices not increase?"]],[3239,["Where the salaries increase, prices also go up."]],[3242,["It is told that in Lanka (tr.n. fom Ramayana)"]],[3246,["there were gold bricks, as currency."]],[3249,["Now, one person went to get gold bricks."]],[3252,["He found that, after working for one day"]],[3255,["he recieved two gold bricks."]],[3257,["After that he went to a barber shop for shave."]],[3261,["He asked the barber: “What are the charges?” “Two bricks”."]],[3265,["As the income, so the expenses."]],[3267,["It is a matter of discretion."]],[3269,["What is the point in grumbling over the price rise, this and that?"]],[3272,["They all do this even to Me."]],[3275,["How much has your salary increased?"]],[3277,["Very, very much! Then?"]],[3280,["Then why to keep crying about the inflation?"]],[3282,["When the salary increases, price increase is bound to happen."]],[3285,["Your salary increases and prices remain the same, how is it possible?"]],[3289,["It's a very simple thing, if we learn this,"]],[3292,["then socially also we could achieve Shiva tattwa."]],[3296,["Now, Gandhiji was an amazing person."]],[3300,["I was in his ashram with him."]],[3303,["I was not bothered at all, but others used to cry."]],[3305,["Because his principle was,"]],[3308,["that all the people had to clean everbody's bathroom,"]],[3311,["the guests' bathroom and everyone's."]],[3313,["And there was no sweeper at all."]],[3317,["Wash your own clothes, wash your own plates."]],[3321,["And the meal consisted of boiled food with mustard oil on top of it."]],[3326,["Now, tell Me how many Indians can eat that type of food?"]],[3331,["People used to stay there for 2-3 days and then run away."]],[3334,["This was the situation."]],[3335,["Now, you people also should learn to less bother about the taste."]],[3339,["Now, as far as oblivion to taste is concerned,"]],[3341,["I don't know how I can do it,"]],[3344,["but you can try to eat only boiled food for a few days."]],[3358,["No mother would say such a thing to her children."]],[3360,["But what can I do? It is damaging your Shiva tattwa."]],[3363,["If all of your attention is on eating and drinking,"]],[3366,["then your Shiva tattwa will disappear"]],[3368,["and all the efforts will go to waste."]],[3370,["So, to get involved too much in eating, is not good."]],[3376,["In olden days, people used to fast for a day or two."]],[3380,["Something or the other they used to sacrifice from their side."]],[3385,["But nowadays it is very difficult to say,"]],[3388,["that if you become contented, become satisfied,"]],[3392,["then it is not necessary for you, absolutely not required,"]],[3396,["to talk all the time about eating and drinking"]],[3399,["and invite others for supper."]],[3402,["Then, in India we have caste system."]],[3405,["Kayasth are separate,"]],[3408,["Hindu brahmins are separate and others are separate, even now."]],[3413,["Now what happens,"]],[3414,["is that all the kayashth Sahaja Yogis form one group,"]],[3417,["brahmin Sahaja Yogis form another group."]],[3419,["Now you all have become Sahaja Yogis,"]],[3421,["then why are you still worried about all this brahminism?"]],[3424,["Then kayasth will invite other kayasths for a meal."]],[3427,["And brahmins will invite other brahmins for a meal."]],[3430,["If you have to do this kind of stupidity,"]],[3432,["then why did you come to Sahaja Yoga?"]],[3434,["There is no caste and creed in Sahaja Yoga."]],[3438,["When you cannot drop this fundamentally wrong thing,"]],[3442,["then what else can you drop?"]],[3444,["Did Shiv Ji bother about caste and creed?"]],[3447,["Even someone with a blind eye,"]],[3450,["someone with broken leg, someone with broken hands,"]],[3453,["all kind of deformed people"]],[3455,["accompanied Him in His marriage procession."]],[3458,["So when Shiva tattwa is like this it is wrong for you to be critical"]],[3465,["and say: \"I am very particular that the food should be like this\"."]],[3472,["And then separate food for kayasth, separate for brahmins,"]],[3476,["separate for other casts and separate for rajputs,"]],[3479,["separate for everyone:"]],[3481,["\"Now, we want only that food\"."]],[3483,["I have never understood, till now I could not understand,"]],[3487,["if there is more pleasure in eating different foods,"]],[3490,["then why do these people ask only for a particular type of food."]],[3495,["What is the reason? For bengalies, bengali food,"]],[3498,["for madrasis, madrasi food."]],[3502,["Once I asked in our Airforce, I mean in the Airlines:"]],[3506,["\"Why there is no good standard food?”."]],[3509,["They said: \"Mother, tell us what is India's standard food?\"."]],[3514,["This is very true."]],[3517,["If you prepare some food, they will say: \"This is Madrasi food\"."]],[3520,["Madrasi will say: \"This is Bihari food\", this and that and that."]],[3525,["So, that's why you should eat all types of food."]],[3533,["Because everything starts from here itself."]],[3535,["This Vaikhari, your speech,"]],[3538,["in your speech as well, there should be sweetness,"]],[3542,["there should be madhurya."]],[3544,["In the smiles also, it feels sometimes,"]],[3546,["as if Ravana is emerging out of the mouth."]],[3550,["Then what can be said about the way they talk?"]],[3553,["And when they talk, it feels as if Chandika is talking."]],[3557,["Women particularly create this fuss."]],[3561,["Even men do it."]],[3564,["Various weird things have come up letely."]],[3567,["Where is Shiva tattwa in this?"]],[3571,["Lord Shiva is the ocean of love."]],[3576,["He bestows boons even on rakshasas."]],[3581,["Shri Shiva who has bestowed boons even on rakshasas -"]],[3584,["if we have to awaken His tattawa within us,"]],[3587,["then how could we get entangled in petty matters like these?"]],[3591,["How can we do this? Tell me."]],[3595,["The way we criticize each other,"]],[3599,["some say \"He is superior\", some say \"He is inferior\","]],[3603,["it is not like Lord Shiva."]],[3605,["The streams of love are flowing within Lord Shiva."]],[3610,["And while flowing in these streams of love –"]],[3614,["you should not say such baseless things."]],[3620,["There is no use of it."]],[3623,["Mutual love,"]],[3625,["mutual understanding"]],[3628,["and the company of each other should be enjoyed."]],[3634,["Now definitely,"]],[3636,["Sahaja Yogis do not fight with each other, I have seen that."]],[3639,["And when they meet each other, they meet with love."]],[3642,["But still, even now very petty matters, which are very personal,"]],[3647,["like eating, drinking, moving around and other daily activities,"]],[3651,["need to be corrected."]],[3654,["If we correct them it will be wonderful."]],[3657,["Your attention will go towards your heart,"]],[3661,["and will not remain in these things,"]],[3664,["will not remain in these matters."]],[3666,["This disease is more in foreign countries."]],[3669,["That's why many enterpreneurs are popping up"]],[3673,["and they manufacture various kinds of things."]],[3676,["And those who wear such things start thinking very high of themselves."]],[3682,["Particularly in Italy this is quite popular."]],[3685,["But you should not get caught in all these things."]],[3691,["You should lead a simple life."]],[3693,["In our country, people who lead a simple life"]],[3698,["have attained great heights."]],[3700,["Others cannot achieve this."]],[3703,["In the olden days when Gandhiji asked everyone to wear khadi cloth,"]],[3708,["everyone obeyed and wore khadi."]],[3711,["He made such a rule"]],[3714,["and set everybody right."]],[3716,["But now you have to set yourself right."]],[3720,["Because you yourself are the light of the Spirit,"]],[3725,["you youreself have come under the protection of Shri Shiva."]],[3731,["You have to correct yourself on your own."]],[3734,["You don't need to correct others,"]],[3737,["but just correct yourself"]],[3739,["and feel blessed that you are a Self Realized person."]],[3742,["How many were there earlier?"]],[3744,["Only a few of them and people used to kill them as well."]],[3747,["Today you are in thousands, so start doing this."]],[3751,["Sweetness in your talk,"]],[3753,["not superficially but from the heart."]],[3756,["Whatever you say from your heart, never hurts anyone."]],[3761,["So you talk from your heart,"]],[3763,["with children, with elderly people,"]],[3765,["following the \"maryadas\" of good conduct."]],[3768,["When you make yourself happy,"]],[3772,["you will make others happy as well."]],[3774,["But, if the blessing of Shri Shiva is missing within you,"]],[3780,["which makes you content,"]],[3784,["nothing else can make you content."]],[3786,["So pay attention to yourself and see: \"Am I content or not?"]],[3790,["Do I have satisfaction or not?"]],[3792,["Do I get angry with others over small, small things"]],[3799,["or do I find faults with them?"]],[3802,["Then definitely there is something wrong with me\"."]],[3805,["And only after seeing these faults, you can get cleansed."]],[3809,["Until you see something, how can you clean it?"]],[3813,["This cleansing is much needed."]],[3815,["And only by this cleansing,"]],[3817,["you can have the \"darshan\" of God Almighty within yourself."]],[3823,["And all the people can have His \"darshan\" as well."]],[3826,["Wish you have infinite blessings."]],[3842,["It's a very long lecture I have given in Hindi language"]],[3846,["and because there are very few, also, Sahaja Yogis from abroad."]],[3851,["What I was telling them was that about the principle of Shiva"]],[3856,["is in your heart,"]],[3859,["and that reflection is not on a chakra, but on a… like a mirror."]],[3866,["Now, whatever is visible of you"]],[3871,["is this mirror."]],[3873,["In this mirror, what reflection you have?"]],[3877,["Do you have a reflection, which is clear, clean?"]],[3882,["Have you cleaned your heart?"]],[3885,["Have you cleaned your mirror that is reflecting?"]],[3892,["That is what one has to see."]],[3894,["Now, what I told them at length was this,"]],[3897,["that how there are six enemies we have got."]],[3903,["And all these six enemies, one after another, try to corrupt us."]],[3909,["Out of that, I have told them about five."]],[3911,["The sixth one doesn’t exist much in India, which we call as lust,"]],[3917,["it's much less."]],[3918,["But, for foreign countries one has to know"]],[3922,["that it is one of the major things that they have in the West,"]],[3926,["because they think lustful life is the only life worth living."]],[3930,["Beyond that is Shiva."]],[3934,["And that’s why we have to understood that, we have to understand"]],[3940,["that in our heart,"]],[3942,["the reflection of Shiva is only possible in complete form"]],[3948,["when we have cleaned our heart."]],[3951,["To have malice for others,"]],[3953,["to have lust for others,"]],[3957,["to have anger for others,"]],[3962,["to have envy for others,"]],[3966,["all these reactions within us act,"]],[3969,["and our heart becomes like a stone,"]],[3972,["it cannot reflect."]],[3975,["So, if you have to reflect the quality of Shiva,"]],[3978,["which is very important today, in this Kali Yuga..."]],[3981,["Very, there are very few people who are really reflecting"]],[3987,["the image of Shiva in their own character."]],[3992,["So, it is important to watch yourself"]],[3994,["and see for yourself what’s wrong with you:"]],[3997,["\"Where am I? Where is my attention going?"]],[4000,["Where am I going? What am I doing?\","]],[4002,["if you go on judging yourself and not others."]],[4006,["Also, one of the western things is that,"]],[4010,["they have a right to criticize others, everybody."]],[4016,["\"I like it, I don’t like it”."]],[4018,["Who are you? Why do you say such a thing?"]],[4021,["Somebody had made a beautiful, say, arrangement for you;"]],[4025,["you sit in his house and nicely say:  “I don’t like it”,"]],[4029,["to hurt that person."]],[4032,["After all, who are you?"]],[4034,["What do you think of yourself?"]],[4037,["Who are you to judge?"]],[4039,["For Sahaja Yoga, Yogis, is prohibited"]],[4042,["to say, “I like” and “I don’t like.”"]],[4045,["It's prohibited."]],[4048,["Look at Shiva. He likes everything."]],[4052,["What He wears? Also snakes."]],[4055,["He likes all kinds of animals."]],[4058,["Every type of thing"]],[4060,["that we think is not good, ugly, for Him they are not."]],[4064,["For example, in His wedding He took with Him, in His bharat,"]],[4069,["people who were all infirm,"]],[4072,["some people had one leg,"]],[4074,["some people had limbs broken down,"]],[4077,["some had only one eye."]],[4080,["All such people He carried with them."]],[4082,["To Him, these people were very dear"]],[4086,["and He looked after them,"]],[4088,["because He is the source of joy."]],[4090,["He is the One who gives us joy"]],[4093,["and the One that makes us joyous."]],[4095,["The real joy is only possible"]],[4098,["if in your heart His reflection is there."]],[4102,["But if your heart is full of all things,"]],[4104,["then once I have described,"]],[4107,["it becomes a dirty, very, very dirty mirror."]],[4112,["Very surprising, I told them also,"]],[4115,["that compared to Indians, Westerners are not so particular -"]],[4119,["Western Sahaja Yogis - are not so particular about their comfort."]],[4123,["Though they come from a very materialistic surrounding,"]],[4126,["they are not so much bothered."]],[4128,["They can live anywhere, they can be happy anywhere."]],[4131,["That’s a very good stage they have reached"]],[4133,["and that’s what’s the Indians must try to follow."]],[4137,["And don’t pay attention to nonsensical things."]],[4140,["It is not necessary to waste your energy on nonsensical thing."]],[4145,["Then only you can have a real bhakti for your Self, for your Atma"]],[4151,["and that is what needed today,"]],[4154,["that your Spirit should shine in your character, in your behavior"]],[4159,["and in your personality."]],[4163,["If that happens, then you have achieved,"]],[4166,["what Sahaja Yoga wanted to do for you."]],[4169,["It's important today, very important."]],[4172,["If you read the newspapers, you can’t read it."]],[4176,["And what you need is to change - the transformation -"]],[4181,["as we in Hindi call it ‘pariwartan’"]],[4184,["of human beings into Selfhood, into Self-awareness,"]],[4189,["into the Spirit."]],[4191,["This has to be done,"]],[4192,["and the time has come this evolutionary process has started."]],[4195,["There are so many of them who have got it."]],[4198,["Now the old saints and people who were gurus, real gurus,"]],[4205,["they used to really test the disciples"]],[4210,["by making them stand on their heads for years together,"]],[4215,["sometimes put them in the water, do all kinds of things."]],[4219,["They used to beat them"]],[4221,["and they were very harsh, testing all of them."]],[4226,["And then only, one of them used to get Realization."]],[4231,["Now, what I thought of:"]],[4233,["\"It takes too much time to cleanse them,"]],[4237,["to put them into all kinds of dresses, this that,"]],[4243,["send them to Himalayas or to Gobi Desert."]],[4247,["I thought it will take too much time."]],[4250,["I said why not first enlighten them, give them the light?"]],[4254,["In that light they can see their problems"]],[4257,["and they will themselves correct themself."]],[4259,["They will be their own guru."]],[4261,["And it was successful. It was good."]],[4265,["Now you can see for yourself what you are doing,"]],[4268,["what is your problem, what makes you so much different from others"]],[4275,["and what will elevate you."]],[4278,["Because Sadashiva’s place is above the head,"]],[4283,["above your thoughts, above your mind,"]],[4286,["above your emotions."]],[4288,["It’s here."]],[4289,["And you have to cross this limit."]],[4291,["Only when you do not react to things,"]],[4294,["and also to you nothing is important than Shiva,"]],[4301,["then only it will work out."]],[4303,["So, in some things Indians have to learn,"]],[4306,["and in some things you foreigners have to learn."]],[4310,["So many things you have done, I must thank you very much."]],[4313,["People used to think that I cannot do anything."]],[4315,["I mean you have given up drinking,"]],[4317,["you have given up all kinds of bad habits,"]],[4319,["you are no more womanizers, your attention is so clean."]],[4323,["So many things you have done, which is really praise-worthy."]],[4326,["But still,"]],[4328,["you must learn that still there are certain things lingering,"]],[4332,["which must be cleared out"]],[4334,["and must be absolutely finished."]],[4337,["You don’t have very much politics"]],[4340,["but sometimes there is also politics, group forming is there."]],[4344,["All this has to go away."]],[4346,["Because for Shiva, what is this? The whole universe is at His feet."]],[4350,["To Him to have a one group here and a one group there,"]],[4355,["all that doesn’t matter."]],[4357,["To Him, it doesn’t come into His head, you see."]],[4360,["For a person like a very big ocean, it touches many shores."]],[4365,["But in itself it is a big ocean."]],[4368,["In the same way is Shiva principle."]],[4371,["And you all should develop that principle of Shiva."]],[4374,["And then see the joy."]],[4376,["the joy of this great ocean of love."]],[4381,["May God bless you."]]]);
